Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "responsibleUserPublicId": "{{memberUserPublicId}}"
}


### ProjectTasks - AssignTask sem autenticação - 401
PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}/projects/{{projetoTenantAdminPublicId}}/tasks/{{assignTaskPublicId}}/responsible
